# SQLite databases and their write-ahead logs. NEVER version these.
# A tracked -wal/-shm is not merely large: `git checkout` will drop a stale
# write-ahead log on top of a live database and corrupt it. That happened on
# 2026-09-12 and cost a rebuild of market_data.db.
data/*.db
data/*.db-wal
data/*.db-shm
